      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A child presented with knee pain, the cause of pain was found on further investigation to be due chondrolysis of the hip joint secondary to a pseudomonas aeruginosa septic arthritis. The patient functionally did well following a subtotal synovectomy and prolonged treatment with appropriate antibiotics."},
